    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[0].noiDungThoai
      value: Greetings, Cultivator.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[1].noiDungThoai
      value: I only know what others have told me. There is a Pixiu stone statue
        in a ruined temple to the north. Covered in moss, it looks no different from
        ordinary weathered stone. Yet they say when night falls, its eyes glow crimson.
        A band of men once ventured in searching for antiques... The next morning,
        only one came running back.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[2].noiDungThoai
      value: When they found them, their eyes were rolled back, blood dripping from
        their ears. As for the sole survivor, he was driven utterly mad, babbling
        nonsense about heaven and earth.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].luaChon1.idThoaiTiepTheo
